/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 101 0 R
/E (If present, lead can cause serious health problems, especially for pregnant women and young children. Vineyard City conducted thirty \(30\) lead samples during 2023. Sampling results can be obtained by emailing devanp@vineyardutah.gov)
/Pg 10 0 R
