/P 102 0 R
/E (We periodically monitor Disinfection By-Products in the distribution system to meet all regulatory requirements. In fourth quarter of 2025 we failed to take the required samples. Testing for a Chlorine Residual is used to ensure that the public is provided with safe drinking water. This violation does not necessarily pose a health risk. We have reviewed why we failed to take the required samples and will take steps to ensure that it will not happen again.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
